<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-willshaw-retinotectal-chemoaffinity> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Prestige & Willshaw (1975) & Brown et al. (2000) EphA/ephrin-A retinotectal chemoaffinity & synaptic competition (Danio rerio zebrafish / Mus musculus vertebrate retinotectal-retinocollicular projection)",
        "Prestige & Willshaw (1975) & Brown et al. (2000) EphA/ephrin-A retinotectal chemoaffinity & synaptic competition faithfully reproduces Danio rerio zebrafish / Mus musculus vertebrate retinotectal-retinocollicular projection morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/willshaw-retinotectal-chemoaffinity-1>,
