    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 1976-willshaw-retinotectal-chemoaffinity.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Danio rerio zebrafish / Mus musculus vertebrate retinotectal-retinocollicular projection specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 56.3/100, audit 2026-10-19-retinotectal-chemoaffinity-audit) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/1976-willshaw-retinotectal-chemoaffinity.py> ;
